- No.

22
00:04:55.702 --> 00:04:58.605
Can I speak to the
person in charge?

23
00:04:59.856 --> 00:05:02.630
- The, uh, captain.
- Captain Yáo, Li-Jie.

24
00:05:02.655 --> 00:05:03.548
<i> Deceased.</i>

25
00:05:03.573 --> 00:05:07.172
Yeah, where, um,
